An essence is one stat, held loose, waiting to be written onto something.

Its quality is what it writes: a quality three essence writes plus three.
Charges are only progress toward the next quality -- ten for each quality it
already has -- and they never enter what it writes.

Distilling into an essence you already carry adds to that one.  That is the
only way an essence grows, and why scattering charges across duplicates is
worth nothing.

Using an essence spends all of it, whatever it wrote, and leaves it at
quality one.

